{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50713","headline":"题河阳新鼓角楼 · 张祜","name":"题河阳新鼓角楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重楼高桍两檐开，晓夕风云会振雷。\n中国最推鼙鼓地，大臣先选陈梁材。\n马悲塞北千羣牧，鴈到城南一半回。\n从此圣朝思将帅，上衣须脱食须推。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}